1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,700
AI safeguards need evidence. A promise is not proof.

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:07,400
Before high-risk AI goes live, ask: What was tested?
Who checked it? Who owns the risk?

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:11,100
Human judgement sets the purpose and limits.

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:14,800
AI supports work within those agreed limits.

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:18,500
People verify important outputs and keep records.

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,200
Monitor outcomes, report incidents and improve controls.

7
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:26,000
If safeguards fail, who can pause or roll back?

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,400
Trust follows evidence. Humans stay accountable.
Palm92. Responsible AI. Evidence first.
